  "script": {
    "main": "src/index.ts",
    "description": "Draws a scanline + phosphor-bloom overlay over the whole shell and drives a faint 60 Hz brightness flicker with requestAnimationFrame. Purely cosmetic: it only adds a fixed, pointer-events:none overlay element and toggles a CSS custom property each frame - it reads no data, calls no other API, and removes the overlay and stops the loop completely when the skin is turned off."
